I agree with Don's observations, especially with his points about
ec/dc fonts. Hopefully a complete set will be available by the time
LaTeX3 will come out.

What about cm compatibility, some will ask? Well, there are always
virtual fonts! And I don't see why it should be much of a problem to
generate these automatically for the whole set. Hmmmm...I might even
be tempted to write a lisp program for that...when I find time :-)

Rainer


